OL,3,GNEWSADrivers face M6 rush hour delays
OL,4,Afollowing crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraffic monitoring service Inrix M6
OL,7,Fsaid southbound traffic had already
OL,8,Fbuilt up to the Croft Interchange at
OL,9,Fjunction 21. Those heading northbound
OL,10,Fcan expect congestion to before
OL,11,Fjunction 19 for Knutsford.
